WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:08.000
Tomorrow's tours are booked. But are the assigned guides confirmed?

00:08.000 --> 00:18.000
Gappy loads twelve sample bookings and surfaces confirmations that still need attention.

00:18.000 --> 00:28.000
The operations team reviews the current booking and approves a simulated request.

00:28.000 --> 00:37.000
The guide replies on a simple operator-branded page. A reply is evidence, not completion.

00:37.000 --> 00:46.000
Gappy checks the latest booking details before marking the current confirmation verified.

00:46.000 --> 00:55.000
The workflow closes only when the guide response and the latest booking details agree.

00:55.000 --> 01:00.000
Operations and guides see the same booking truth. See how this fits your operation. Book a demo.
